This patch adds an extra option like "runmode" called "monster_runmode",
setting this to "teleport" results in NetHack behaving as it always did.
Setting it to any other values sets monster movement slower, enabling you,
the player, to see each monster's individual movement, including delays
between messages sent to the message window. One example of when this is
usefull is when attacked by a large quantity of "exactly the same
monster", if one monster has a better weapon or does more damage etc, it's
easier to pick out exactly which one.

